WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:06.220
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, this is going
to be my Korra episode 3 video.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:11.200
If you’re a night owl like me then you saw
this drop early on Amazon.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.440
For some reason the episodes will post there
right after midnight pacific time.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.670
They’re not free, it’s not a leak or anything.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.369
But usually Nick doesn’t post them till
about 5AM.

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:21.130
So it’s a nice bonus.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.500
New round of the giveaway starts now, all
you have to do to enter is be a subscriber

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.269
and leave a comment.

00:00:26.269 --> 00:00:29.090
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
it yet.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.800
But starting with top 5 moments -

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.519
Number 5 - Prince Wu’s Coronation

00:00:33.519 --> 00:00:34.940
Starting with the dance of the badger moles.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:38.930
Best dance ever, but it reminded me of the
Badger Mole song from last airbender.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.510
That was from book 2 episode 2.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.750
Cave of two lovers.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.160
Which is also the episode with the secret
tunnel song.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:51.100
They actually sang that song at san diego
comic con, dee bradley baker was there for

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.649
another show so he came by and did it again.

00:00:53.649 --> 00:00:55.850
They’re very clearly positioning Wu as someone
who’s completely disconnected from people.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:56.950
Just totally tuned out from reality.

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:10.750
I flipped a little when he walked up to Kuvira
and pretty clearly sexually harassed her.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:15.380
I loved the way they very clearly want us
to think Kuvira is evil, but make us root

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.380
for her.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.320
Like she has the wicked grin and the creepy
music cue as she makes fun of Wu.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.910
But you want to laugh at Wu.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:22.910
Maybe laugh nervously.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:30.509
That is a pretty creepy face.

00:01:30.509 --> 00:01:33.729
The Bolin Eska meetup was priceless.

00:01:33.729 --> 00:01:37.260
I think she might only be a minor character
in this book, and because Bolin is with Opal,

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:38.260
who’s totally awesome.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:41.010
I don’t expect any of the typical love triangle
stuff to happen.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:46.259
Like if this were book 1 or 2, Bolin would
be like Mako trying to balance two women.

00:01:46.259 --> 00:01:49.880
I’m glad they’re not doing that this time.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.390
I don’t think anyone was surprised with
Kuvira’s scary rhetoric.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.820
She always gets what she wants…

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:59.860
And we finally got some more context about
what happened in Zhaofu after the death of

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:01.129
the earth queen.

00:02:01.129 --> 00:02:06.140
Suyin wanted to wait it out and Kuvira charged
in determined to fix things.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:10.170
That’s why, as bolin put it so eloquently,
she’s just like Korra.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.750
She’s the gung-ho empress.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.170
I guess we should call her now.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.250
Empress Kuvira of the New Earth Empire.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:19.810
I know a lot of you have pointed out similarities
to Chin the Conqueror.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:21.790
The first Emperor of China.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:27.310
I know everyone was hoping to see Kyoshi warriors
at the ceremony, but she did get the Kyoshi

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.310
Freedom Medal.

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:29.310
And then proceeded to crush it.

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.920
I like the metaphor in Kuvira crushing a symbol
of freedom.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:36.350
The whole ceremony was intended to split people,
so don’t feel bad if you came out rooting

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:37.350
for Kuvira.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.440
That’s what Mike and Bryan want.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:42.170
They don’t want there to be a readily identifiable
villain right now.

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:47.650
Obviously Kuvira will be the ultimate villain,
but not in the traditional Dark Avatar sense.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.620
Number 4 - Everybody Hates Wu

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:58.520
Mako finally let’s him have it in the Palace
restaurant.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:03.190
Just to be clear, they were still in republic
city.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.420
The palace was just a restaurant modeled to
look like the royal palace.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:11.430
I almost cried a little bit when I saw Bosco,
remember how the earth queen implied she ate

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.430
him.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:16.210
I guess it’s fitting he appear stuffed in
a restaurant that looks like his old home.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:21.480
I love the way Bryke has added memorabilia
from last airbender to korra scenes.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.700
Like the Aang carnival games in book 2.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.370
I would totally go to an avatar themed restaurant.

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:29.319
Maybe we can get them to do that.

00:03:29.319 --> 00:03:31.630
Even a little hole in the wall tea shop.

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:36.820
Kuvira is the star and it seems like the only
people who understand what’s really going

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.790
on are the politicians like Suyin and Tenzin.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:43.300
Even President Reiko was suprised when she
refused to lay down power.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:47.091
This is going to be a big problem for Korra
when she tries to bring balance to the Earth

00:03:47.091 --> 00:03:48.091
Empire.

00:03:48.091 --> 00:03:49.091
I guess we should just call it that for now.

00:03:49.091 --> 00:03:52.130
Number 3 - The Other Nations Are Powerless
To Stop Kuvira

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:56.150
Varrick explained that the Earth Empire had
precious metals that the other nations needed

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.150
to survive.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:02.170
So all Kuvira has to do to put pressure on
them is cut off the supply of metal from their

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.170
mines.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.790
There’s also that giant mechanical army
she has.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:09.590
The highspeed rail Varrick constructed gives
her an fast way to mobilize her army too.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.470
That’s how she’ll be able to defend her
borders.

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.370
Speaking of which, she’s going after zhaofu
next.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.280
She’ll make them sign the treaty or go down
fighting.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:20.489
That’s probably why Suyin is hanging her
head here looking all sad.

00:04:20.489 --> 00:04:23.530
It also looks like she’s in the body of
a mech, I think I saw pictures of Water Tribe

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.530
mechs too.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.310
They might have been from the video game,
but I’m guessing all of the nations have

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.310
access to them via Future Industries.

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:33.120
In case you missed it too, Varrick explained
that Kuvira forced President Reiko to pardon

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:37.870
him, so it’s possible she did the same thing
for Asami’s Father so he’d help design

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.240
new mechs for her army.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:44.090
So Kuvira has what seems like her own mahattan
project team of scientists building things

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:48.210
for her and economically she’s got the rest
of the world by the balls.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:52.320
Number 2 - Varrick is Exploiting Spirit Energy

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:55.840
As weird as that looks, he’s probably just
using it to power the engine.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.220
I didn’t notice any extra special weaponry.

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:00.761
They’ll probably find a way to harness the
spiritual energy the vines give off and use

00:05:00.761 --> 00:05:01.761
it as power for their tech.

00:05:01.761 --> 00:05:04.390
Not just the rail, but the mechs, probably
some pretty badass giant weapons we haven’t

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.390
seen yet.

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:08.820
In a sense, they’re cannibalizing the spirit
world to power their innovation.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.750
We know the vines serve as a home for the
spirits, but it’s also possible they’re

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.430
necessary for their survival.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:19.270
Like fast forward and you see all the spirits
slowly dying off because the Earth Empire

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.030
has used up that natural resource.

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.350
Or perverted it in some way.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:25.500
That look on Varrick’s face, is not a good
look.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.850
The interesting thing is that I think by the
end of the season, once a final compromise

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:32.261
is reached, there will be some sort of technological
synergy between the spirit world and the physical

00:05:32.261 --> 00:05:33.261
world.

00:05:33.261 --> 00:05:34.419
Like, they’ll find a positive version of
whatever Varrick is doing.

00:05:34.419 --> 00:05:37.370
It kind of reminds me of clean energy with
a magical twist.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.810
Like using Nethicite to power stuff in Final
Fantasy 13.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:43.530
and my number 1 moment - Korra and Toph Swamp
Time

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.990
I wish every time could be swamp time with
Toph.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:50.620
I like that they spent what looked like a
couple hours of Toph kicking Korra’s but

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.520
before Toph finally explained there was metal
fragments left in her body.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.160
She probably sensed those in last week’s
episode.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.750
Toph is great with the tough love.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.110
It really is classic Toph, they totally nailed
her with the writing.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:05.210
It was like watching last airbender Toph.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.210
Favorite Toph Quotes were:

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:08.560
“I’m the Original Beifong” - meaning
she’s the original grumpy beifong

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:12.020
“I forgot how much I loved tormenting the
avatar”

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.500
and “You’re the worst Avatar I’ve ever
worked with” and then she completely buys

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.500
back her joke saying yeah yeah, I’ve only
known one other Avatar.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.310
I also loved that she made fun of the other
swamp benders.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.110
Implying that at some point she’d kicked
all their butts.

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:25.691
It wasn’t so much funny, but she does have
that very Yoda Jedi Master moment when she

00:06:25.691 --> 00:06:30.130
explains that because she’s deeply connected
to the earth and the earth is everywhere,

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:33.040
she’s connected to everyone all over the
place.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.970
She can’t see Lin and Suyin, but she can
sense them.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:39.949
So in a way, she probably knows about everything
that’s been going on since Book 1.

00:06:39.949 --> 00:06:41.889
She’s trying to make Korra see the big picture.

00:06:41.889 --> 00:06:45.360
That’s why she made light of her time as
police cheif and all of Korra’s victories.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:49.470
Toph feels like, in the grand scheme of the
universe, none of that little stuff matters.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:54.500
Regardless of how little you think Harmonic
Convergence was.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:59.350
Let me know what your favorite moment was
and do you think Kuvira is going to use the

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.590
spirit vines to power big big weapons eventually?

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:06.000
Overall I gave the episode a solid A minus
for feeling like a great classic last airbender

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.000
parable.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.920
And a great Yoda Toph episode.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:12.710
She such a big character, I feel like it would
be wrong to give the big lessons to someone

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:17.540
else.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:25.070
The tough love stuff is just for laughs, I
think by the end of the season she’ll take

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.500
a more active role.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:37.210
I would be pissed if she vaporized into spirit
form like Yoda.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:41.770
The story is more interesting now than it’s
ever been.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:46.210
Kuvira is like Sephiroth and Varrick is like
Shinra.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:49.490
They’re exploiting nature in the name of
progress and pushing their way of life on

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.509
everyone with the threat of voilence.

00:07:51.509 --> 00:07:56.949
So of course Korra is going to have to stop
her from taking the world in a bad direction.

00:07:56.949 --> 00:08:03.259
As for all the new bits of technology, I think
part of the balance theme this season will

00:08:03.259 --> 00:08:05.710
be them learning to use all those things without
hurting people.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:14.990
Even if the spirit vine batteries don’t
hurt the spirits, they’ll still probably

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:22.240
be used for weapons of mass destruction.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:32.240
I’m loving how Bryke is testing our loyalties
to certain characters and I can’t wait to

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.219
see how Korra gets back into action.

00:08:35.219 --> 00:08:37.149
I do think she’ll heal herself.

00:08:37.149 --> 00:08:41.360
Even if she doesn’t pull the metal out,
she’ll find a way to turn it into a positive.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:46.100
Don’t forget, I’ll announce this week’s
giveaway winner in my Q&amp;A tomorrow.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.550
So leave all your questions.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:52.370
I’ve got a few extra videos I have to get
out this weekend but I’ll try to get a Bonus

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:53.929
Avatar video done.

00:08:53.929 --> 00:08:54.929
Maybe like a classic Toph video.

00:08:54.929 --> 00:08:55.929
That would be fun.

00:08:55.929 --> 00:08:59.550
Right now click here for the Q&amp;A, I’ll update
the annotation as soon as I post it and click

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.139
here for my episode 2 video.

00:09:01.139 --> 00:09:05.690
Thanks for watching, now let’s all high
five and I’ll see you guys tonight!

